      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JOLANNA (2) was impressive last time, posting an effortless 4.5 lengths win in taking a Maiden in 24.63 and a new Best time this course and distance. Can measure up again if runs up to latest. BELMONDO BLUE (1) finished sixth last time at Warrnambool but could not have been more impressive a few runs back in her quick 24.11 win at Traralgon over 425m. Has the ability and can find winning form again. LAKEVIEW SKY (3) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Missed the frame latest (30.78) when seventh over 525m at The Meadows in a Grade 5. Can feature in the finish. DR. HONEY (8) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
